          <p>
            The quick read: rice-only powders tend to deliver slightly less protein per serving and need a little more volume to match whey on leucine. The blends land in the 20 to 24 g range and round out the amino acid profile. Thorne is the only pick here with a sport certification, which also means its batches are screened for contaminants, a meaningful advantage in a rice-based product. For the wider plant category, see our <a href="/best-plant-based-protein-powder/">best plant-based protein powder</a> guide.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Picks -->
        <div id="top-picks" class="scroll-mt-24">
